1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,599
you weren't at school last week Simon where were you
西蒙，上周你不在学校，你在哪里？

2
00:00:04,599 --> 00:00:06,839
I was at home because
我在家是因为

3
00:00:06,839 --> 00:00:10,060
I wasn't well what was the matter
我不舒服，有什么事吗？

4
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:13,599
I was ill last Monday
上周一我病了

5
00:00:13,599 --> 00:00:21,859
I had a temperature it was 39 degrees wow what was the matter
我的体温是39度，哇，怎么回事？

6
00:00:22,359 --> 00:00:23,980
I don't know
我不知道。

7
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:28,539
I drank lots of water but on Tuesday
我喝了很多水，但是在星期二

8
00:00:28,559 --> 00:00:31,480
I was worse and
我更糟而且

9
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:39,380
