10
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:48,740
I had a terrible cough so I saw the doctor he gave me some medicine were you better after you took the medicine
我咳嗽得很厉害，所以我去看医生，他给了我一些药。你吃药后好点了吗？

11
00:00:49,119 --> 00:01:00,100
no I wasn't on Thursday I went to the hospital with Mum and had some tests so what was the matter
不，我周四不在，我和妈妈去了医院，做了一些测试，这是怎么回事？

12
00:01:02,359 --> 00:01:03,939
I had a cold
我感冒了

13
00:01:05,239 --> 00:01:05,519
but
但是

14
00:01:05,519 --> 00:01:08,379
I wasn't ill on Friday afternoon
星期五下午我没生病

15
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,659
I was fine
我本来没事的

16
00:01:11,239 --> 00:01:13,459
I ate a big dinner
我吃了一顿丰盛的晚餐

17
00:01:16,079 --> 00:01:17,040
and then
然后

18
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:19,739
I had a really good weekend
我周末过得很愉快

